cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use open-llm-router, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "open-llm-router"
abstract: >-
  Open-source LLM router for locally hosted models. It exposes OpenAI- and
  Anthropic-compatible APIs, supports Keycloak SSO and local accounts with
  per-user API keys, and routes requests to Ollama, vLLM and SGLang backends.
  The web portal provides access controls, usage accounting and personal
  request tracing with user-controlled capture and retention.
type: software
authors:
